---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import { u } from "../lib/u";
---
<Layout title="Cookie Policy — CourseDepth" description="CourseDepth keeps cookies to a minimum — here is exactly what we store.">
<Header />
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><h1>Cookie Policy</h1><p>CourseDepth keeps cookies to a minimum — here is exactly what we store.</p></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container" style="max-width:760px">
<h2>Essential cookies</h2>
<p>A small set of cookies (or local storage entries) is required to remember interface preferences such as a collapsed menu. Without them the site would not work correctly.</p>
<h2>Analytics</h2>
<p>We use first-party, aggregated analytics with no cross-site tracking and no advertising profiles. No personal identifier is stored in your browser for this.</p>
<h2>Third-party cookies</h2>
<p>Course pages link out to providers such as Udemy. When you follow those links the provider's own cookie policy applies — we have no control over them.</p>
<h2>Managing cookies</h2>
<p>You can clear or block cookies in your browser settings at any time. Blocking essential cookies may break parts of the site.</p>
<h2>Updates</h2>
<p>Any change to this policy is published on this page. Last updated: October 2026.</p>
<p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;margin-top:28px">Questions? <a href="/contact" style="font-weight:700">Contact us</a> — read more in our <a href="/about-us" style="font-weight:700">about page</a>.</p>
</div></section>
<Footer />
</Layout>
